  "title": "Mulvihill Canadian Bank Enhanced Yield ETF Declares Monthly Distribution",
  "summary": "TORONTO , Oct. 02, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- (TSX: CBNK) Mulvihill Canadian Bank Enhanced Yield ETF has declared a monthly cash distribution in the amount of $0.058333 per unit, payable on November 7, 2025 to unitholders of record on October 31, 2025 .",
